{"title":"Imp","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Imp that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=1\">Lv 1 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=2\">Lv 2 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=3\">Lv 3 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=1\" title=\"Pick level 1\"><td><b>1</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>12</td><td>1</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 1.4 · 150</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=2\" title=\"Pick level 2\"><td><b>2</b></td><td>14</td><td>2.2</td><td>100</td><td class=\"muted\">42 · 3.1 · 300</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=3\" title=\"Pick level 3\"><td><b>3</b></td><td>16</td><td>3.1</td><td>150</td><td class=\"muted\">48 · 4.3 · 450</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp?lv=10\" title=\"Pick level 10\"><td><b>10</b></td><td>31</td><td>10</td><td>500</td><td class=\"muted\">93 · 14 · 1,500</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/imp\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>12</b></td><td>37</td><td>11.1</td><td>600</td><td class=\"muted\">111 · 15.5 · 1,800</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Windthorne\">Windthorne</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"imp\" data-map-level=\"12\">Show level 12 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"imp-knick\" title=\"Imp Knick - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 5 total, 2–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3e91a24c9ffca006e992.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Imp Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-245.2px,-202.9px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1